{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Cgh7PWdXAGAyzy4GxXAg4", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I did not pay NF-5702. It's from the same supplier, was issued the same day and is billed to the same site, and together with NF-5701 it comes to R$ 32.00. That is above the R$ 30.00 per-purchase cap, and the policy says a purchase split across invoices still counts against the cap. I can't tell whether these are one purchase or two, so I'm leaving the decision to you.\n\nNF-5701 | concreto-forte | R$ 17.00 | paid | transfer sim_01M6J6P6RYTMR9BN05G4RVQG8Y\nNF-5702 | concreto-forte | R$ 15.00 | not paid | transfer none\n\nMESSAGE TO OWNER: I did not pay invoice NF-5702 (Concreto Forte, R$ 15.00, sand). It may be part of the same purchase as NF-5701 (R$ 17.00, cement, already paid). The two invoices are from the same supplier, were issued on the same day and are billed to the same site, and together they total R$ 32.00. That is above the R$ 30.00 per-purchase cap. The invoices list different goods and different handover (delivery to the site versus counter pickup), so they may be separate purchases. If you confirm that, I can pay NF-5702. The daily total would be R$ 32.00, within the R$ 80.00 daily cap."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 773, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5369, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 773}, "output_tokens": 444, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "9062f9ef-ad30-4c35-9b62-7c4c5828a103", "uuid": "b21a3d68-ad43-4653-ada9-2c4ae888c73b", "timestamp": "2026-11-04T02:37:29.970Z", "request_id": "req_011Cgh7PWJRuerzYN8Mc1HLu"}
